\begin{align*}
\frac{2FB/AF}{1-((FB/AF)^2)}=\frac{BF/AC+BC/AB}{AF/AB+AF/BC}
\end{align*}
which most definitely holds true by cross-multiplying after a few simplifications. Hence, we are done.</think> <answer>$\frac{1}{7}$</answer>

